pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$soft"
elements:
  - elementId: accent-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 32, 56, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 48, 860, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 一个课堂、同一进度，为什么有的孩子越学越吃力？
  - elementId: card-left
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 110, 410, 260]
    shapeName: roundRect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$white"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$line"
  - elementId: card-left-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 130, 360, 32]
    content:
      style: "$cardTitle"
      wrap: false
      text: 现实困境
  - elementId: card-left-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 180, 360, 160]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>42%</strong> 小学生认为数学最难学好</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">班级掌握度差异高达 <strong>30%+</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">统一进度下，缺口只会越拖越远</p>
  - elementId: card-right
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 110, 420, 260]
    shapeName: roundRect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$white"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$line"
  - elementId: card-right-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 130, 370, 32]
    content:
      style: "$cardTitle"
      wrap: false
      text: 核心洞察
  - elementId: card-right-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 180, 370, 160]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>同一进度推着所有人走</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">每个孩子的知识缺口完全不同</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">有人卡在「小数乘法」</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">有人困在「分数除法」</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 400, 860, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      fontFamily: {latin: MiSans, ea: MiSans}
      text: |
        <p>用同一个节奏教全班，跟不上的孩子只会越拖越远。</p>
        <p><strong>ILearn 要解决的，就是这个真实困境。</strong></p>
